    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Onde",
     "texto": [
      "For places, use **onde** (where): **A cidade onde nasci** (the city where I was born).",
      "With **em que** the same is said for things: **o bairro em que vives** (the neighbourhood in which you live)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Prepositions with people",
     "texto": [
      "With a person, you can use **preposition + quem**: **a pessoa com quem falaste** (the person you spoke with), **a professora de quem gosto** (the teacher I like). **a pessoa com a qual falei** also exists, in a more formal register.",
      "The preposition depends on the verb: **gostar de**, **falar com**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
